 ## Background
-The method is described in "Volumetric Multi-View Rendering" [S1]. It is presented as a baseline comparison to the proposed MWIS estimator, highlighting the limitations of standard MIS in multi-view volumetric rendering. The concept of Full MIS in BPT is discussed in "A Null-Scattering Path Integral Formulation of Light Transport" [S2, unofficial], which provides context for the importance of full path PDFs in medium sampling.
